#: cli/main.cpp
msgid ""
"Usage: workbox <command> [options]\n"
"\n"
"Runs containers, each a separate place to work, that share nothing with the "
"host.\n"
"\n"
"Commands:\n"
"  create  Create a workbox\n"
"  list    List the workboxes\n"
"  info    Show a workbox\n"
"  start   Start a workbox\n"
"  stop    Stop a workbox\n"
"  enter   Open a shell in a workbox\n"
"  rm      Remove a workbox and its home\n"
"\n"
"\"workbox <command> --help\" shows a command's options; \"workbox --"
"version\", its version."
msgstr ""

